=00_AftGLnXW_LkhnIVShwiQJGShMhqcsFrlxbHPgNxX8u8Q2g&oe=69A5751E"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "247096786454689", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162682_132381304133910_8499134903143628800_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LTlQzgDXZKMQ7kNvwEAHJG1&_nc_oc=AdlRjTVvapYQ3yzgzXIubhFYJYNPHORvRvN8qhirp0MYmE7lhsH-KmDM1QLdhOaH5M0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs_vdq1eV-TjeQthoU0sVdRUSuBfd0TgRGMmhUo4dH6Uw&oe=69A56DA2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "coco_video_7.png", "id": "138276410159384", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162696_138276413492717_1494748721810767872_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JgYs4sqrmPoQ7kNvwFykZMk&_nc_oc=Adm7h7c1W6O5wy-CkfwF1GqOnMM8pNZJpDJApsyy-tNKMZygnSW7E0KpCXPctCnFfUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvYWyfr7FUUBQAonUPMuW_TKSaS1GIFnGi1ZCsSF4o8hA&oe=69A599ED"}, "display_name": "Coco VR", "keywords": ["Coco", "VR", "Disney", "Pixar", "Oculus"], "long_description": "Coco VR is Pixar\u2019s stunning debut into virtual reality: an adventure into the beautiful Disney-Pixar film, Coco, coming to theaters November 22.  \n\nFollow the magical alebrije into the luminous world of Coco filled with lovable characters and beautiful settings from the film.\n\nFEATURES\n* Meet Miguel, Ceci, and Hector in fascinating locations featured in the movie.\n* Express your uniqueness and rock a new style in Ceci\u2019s costume shop.\n* Take a gondola ride and see the gorgeous city from above.\n* Live a little in the spotlight!  You\u2019re the star alongside of Hector in a musical celebration of Dia de los Muertos!", "short_description": "Introducing Pixar Animation Studios\u2019 first VR experience with the visual - and storytelling - magic only Pixar could produce. You and your friends will explore the world of Disney\u2022Pixar's newest film, Coco, in this social VR experience."}]}, "develop